# `apps/runner` is NOT ignored, deliberately.
#
# It used to be: the runner is a long-lived Playwright server that cannot run on
# Vercel, and including it only got it type-checked by a build that would never
# deploy it. That stopped being true when the site started running automations
# itself — the engine it runs is the runner's own, imported through
# `apps/runner/src/serverless.ts`. Excluding the directory removes that file from
# the build, and the build fails on an import it cannot resolve.

extension
scripts
suite-shots
supabase
